  "summary": "Malicious code in dex-creator (npm)",
  "details": "The package communicates with a domain associated with malicious activity.\n\n---\n_-= Per source details. Do not edit below this line.=-_\n\n## Source: ossf-package-analysis (a45a7bed266fa05cf91945ed835fdf225abff89dd8dcde90c90dc769b04e15e3)\nThe OpenSSF Package Analysis project identified 'dex-creator' @ 2.0.0 (npm) as malicious.\n\nIt is considered malicious because:\n\n- The package communicates with a domain associated with malicious activity.\n\n- The package executes one or more commands associated with malicious behavior.\n",
